      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Nurses' knowledge and making decisions in Cancer Pain Management contribute much to the improvement of cancer patients' QOL. Based on the practice of a expert nurse involved in Cancer Pain Management, we have developed the algorithm, which clarified that nurses implement much of observations or complicated decision-makings in Cancer Pain Manage Hereafter it is a significant challenge to examine its consistency and validity to develop its system."},
